 "speech": {
  "language": "en",
  "text": "I want to introduce myself to the Antelope Valley. I'm Dr. Certified Oral and Maxal Facial Surgeon, and I'm proud to be joining the team here at AV Dental Surgery Center in Palmville. I trained at University Medical Center and Cornell University. And for the past 15 years, I've served as the on -call dental trauma surgeon for the NBA's Los Angeles Clippers. I've built my career around complex surgical cases, implants, oral surgery, biopsies, corrective procedures, and now I'm bringing it all of that here to this community.",
